{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2022-08-10 16:41:00', 'title': 'TEXAS INSTRUMENTS PRICES $700 MILLION OF INVESTMENT GRADE NOTES', 'text': 'DALLAS , AUG. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TEXAS INSTRUMENTS INCORPORATED (TI) (NASDAQ: TXN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF TWO SERIES OF SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES FOR AN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $700 MILLION. THE NOTES CONSIST OF THE FOLLOWING: $400 MILLION OF 3.650% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE AUGUST 16, 2032; AND $300 MILLION OF 4.100% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE AUGUST 16, 2052.'}